<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41468" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕtentĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		retineo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a keeping back</i>, i. e., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A holding back</i>, <i>holding
			in</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aurigae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 13, 21, 3</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">13, 25, 1</span></i>.—<b>Trop.</b>, <i>a withholding</i>: assensionis (as a
			transl. of the Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐποχή</span>),
					<i><span class="en">Cic. Ac. 2, 18, 59</span></i>, and 2, 24,
			78.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A keeping back</i>, <i>retaining</i>
			(postclass.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dotis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					31, 1, 79</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">5, 3, 19</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">10, 1, 30</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">urinae,</span>”
				<i>retention</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
					Aur. Tard. 3, 8</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Preservation</i>, <i>maintenance</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">societatis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lact. 6, 10 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">veteris disciplinae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Marc. 5, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">delicti,</span>”
				i. e. <i>not to forgive</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 28</span></i>
			.—In plur., <i><span class="en">Vitr. 9,
			4</span></i>.</div>
